ADDITIONAL NOTICE — SECURITY TESTING SCOPE

This repository contains defensive security tooling, security tests, and
security documentation intended for use against the application and
infrastructure defined *within this repository only*.

All data in `sample-data/`, `tests/fixtures/`, and the documentation is
synthetic. No real customer data, real AWS account identifiers, real
credentials, or findings from third-party systems are included.

Do not use the security tests or tooling in this repository against systems
you do not own or do not have explicit written authorization to test.
